		<button class="margin_T30 S_L_btn" onclick="maillink('/PAGEGWS/GWS1001/GWS1001_R01.aspx')" ><img src="../../images/icon_01.png"/> 메일쓰기</button>
	</div>
  <div class="Sub_left_mn padding_L30 padding_B10 padding_T10 border_Tno p_mail">
		<ul class="margin_B5">
			<li><a href="javascript:maillink('/PAGEGWS/GWS1002/GWS1002_S01.aspx')"><div class="Sub_left_mn_in"><img src="../../images/icon_02.png"/></div><span>받은메일함</span><em class="mail_cnt"></em></a></li>
      <li><a href="javascript:maillink('/PAGEGWS/GWS1002/GWS1002_S08.aspx')"><div class="Sub_left_mn_in"><img src="../../images/icon_03.png"/></div><span>내게쓴메일함</span></a></li>
			<li><a href="javascript:maillink('/PAGEGWS/GWS1002/GWS1002_S02.aspx')"><div class="Sub_left_mn_in"><img src="../../images/icon_03.png"/></div><span>보낸메일함</span></a></li>
			<li><a href="javascript:maillink('/PAGEGWS/GWS1002/GWS1002_S03.aspx')"><div class="Sub_left_mn_in"><img src="../../images/icon_04.png"/></div> <span>중요메일함</span></a></li>
			<li><a href="javascript:maillink('/PAGEGWS/GWS1002/GWS1002_S04.aspx')"><div class="Sub_left_mn_in"><img src="../../images/icon_05.png"/></div> <span>임시보관함</span></a></li>
			<li><a href="javascript:maillink('/PAGEGWS/GWS1002/GWS1002_S05.aspx')"><div class="Sub_left_mn_in"><img src="../../images/icon_06.png"/></div> <span>예약메일함</span></a></li>
		</ul>
	</div>
	<div class="Sub_left_mn p_mail">
		<ul id="custom_mailbox">
			<li class="padding_L30 margin_B3 padding_T10">
				<div class="Sub_left_mn_in"><img src="../../images/icon_08.png"/> </div> <span>내메일함</span>
				<div class="My_mail">
					<img src="../../images/icon_09.png"  style="cursor:pointer" onClick="javascript:mailfunction(addmailbox());"/><img src="../../images/icon_10.png"  style="cursor:pointer" onClick="javascript:mailfunction(setting())"/>
				</div>	
			</li>
		</ul>
	</div>
	<div class="Sub_left_mn padding_L30 p_mail">
		<ul>
			<li class="padding_T3">
        <a href="javascript:maillink('/PAGEGWS/GWS1002/GWS1002_S06.aspx')"><div class="Sub_left_mn_in"><img src="../../images/icon_07.png"/></div> <span>스팸메일함</span></a>
      </li>
			<li class="margin_B5">
				<a href="javascript:maillink('/PAGEGWS/GWS1003/GWS1003_S01.aspx')" class="Sub_left_mn_PD"><div class="Sub_left_mn_in"><img src="../../images/icon_13.png"/> </div> <span>휴지통</span></a>						
			</li>
		</ul>
	</div>

  <div class="Sub_left_mn p_mail">
    <ul>
      <li class="padding_L30  margin_B5 padding_T3">
        <a href="javascript:maillink('/PAGEGWS/GWS1003/GWS1003_R01.aspx')" class="Sub_left_mn_PD">
          <div class="Sub_left_mn_in">
            <img src="../../images/icon_14.png"/>
          </div>
          <span>환경설정</span>
        </a>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <% } %>
  <div class="Sub_left_mn padding_L30 padding_B10 padding_T10">
    <ul id="daummail_ul">
      <li style="font-size:15px; color:white; font-family:'nanum_gothic';">다음 메일<button id="daumwrite" onclick="daumwrite()">메일쓰기</button>
    </li>
		</ul>
	</div>
	<div class="border_T9a">
	</div>


		
